{"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"mdxjsEsm","value":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":1,"column":87,"offset":86}},"data":{"estree":{"type":"Program","start":0,"end":86,"loc":{"start":{"line":1,"column":0,"offset":0},"end":{"line":1,"column":86,"offset":86}},"body":[{"type":"ImportDeclaration","start":0,"end":86,"loc":{"start":{"line":1,"column":0,"offset":0},"end":{"line":1,"column":86,"offset":86}},"specifiers":[{"type":"ImportSpecifier","start":9,"end":23,"loc":{"start":{"line":1,"column":9,"offset":9},"end":{"line":1,"column":23,"offset":23}},"imported":{"type":"Identifier","start":9,"end":23,"loc":{"start":{"line":1,"column":9,"offset":9},"end":{"line":1,"column":23,"offset":23}},"name":"ArticleSection","range":[9,23]},"local":{"type":"Identifier","start":9,"end":23,"loc":{"start":{"line":1,"column":9,"offset":9},"end":{"line":1,"column":23,"offset":23}},"name":"ArticleSection","range":[9,23]},"range":[9,23]}],"source":{"type":"Literal","start":31,"end":85,"loc":{"start":{"line":1,"column":31,"offset":31},"end":{"line":1,"column":85,"offset":85}},"value":"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection","raw":"\"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\"","range":[31,85]},"range":[0,86]}],"sourceType":"module","comments":[],"range":[0,86]}}},{"type":"heading","depth":1,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solana 上的 NFT","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":3,"offset":92},"end":{"line":3,"column":16,"offset":105}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1,"offset":90},"end":{"line":3,"column":16,"offset":105}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"image","title":null,"url":"/graphics/course-banners/nfts-on-solana.png","alt":"Solana 上的 NFT","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1,"offset":109},"end":{"line":5,"column":62,"offset":170}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1,"offset":109},"end":{"line":5,"column":62,"offset":170}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"非同質化代幣（NFT）是具有特定特徵的數字代幣，這些特徵使其與像加密貨幣這樣的同質化代幣有所不同。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":174},"end":{"line":7,"column":50,"offset":223}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":174},"end":{"line":7,"column":50,"offset":223}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"與每個單位都相同且可互換的同質化代幣不同，NFT 代表獨特的、不可分割的數字資產，無法被複製或細分。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":227},"end":{"line":9,"column":51,"offset":277}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":227},"end":{"line":9,"column":51,"offset":277}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"NFTs Properties","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":17,"offset":297},"end":{"line":11,"column":39,"offset":319}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"nft-properties","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":40,"offset":320},"end":{"line":11,"column":59,"offset":339}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":60,"offset":340},"end":{"line":11,"column":70,"offset":350}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":281},"end":{"line":11,"column":73,"offset":353}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"要使代幣符合真正 NFT 的資格，它必須具備以下基本特性：","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":357},"end":{"line":13,"column":30,"offset":386}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":357},"end":{"line":13,"column":30,"offset":386}}},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"start":null,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"不可分割性：不包含小數位，確保您無法擁有 0.1 個 NFT 這樣的分數","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":3,"offset":390},"end":{"line":14,"column":39,"offset":426}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":3,"offset":390},"end":{"line":14,"column":39,"offset":426}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1,"offset":388},"end":{"line":14,"column":39,"offset":426}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"獨特性：供應量恰好為 1，保證僅存在一個實例","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":3,"offset":430},"end":{"line":15,"column":25,"offset":452}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":3,"offset":430},"end":{"line":15,"column":25,"offset":452}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":428},"end":{"line":15,"column":25,"offset":452}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"固定供應量：不存在鑄造權限，防止創建額外的代幣","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":3,"offset":456},"end":{"line":16,"column":26,"offset":479}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":3,"offset":456},"end":{"line":16,"column":26,"offset":479}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1,"offset":454},"end":{"line":16,"column":26,"offset":479}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"可分組性：可以組織成集合，將相似的代幣分組，同時保持個體的獨特性","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":483},"end":{"line":17,"column":35,"offset":515}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":483},"end":{"line":17,"column":35,"offset":515}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":481},"end":{"line":17,"column":35,"offset":515}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"豐富的元數據：包括可讀數據，例如名稱、描述、圖片和其他屬性，用於在瀏覽器和錢包中顯示","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":519},"end":{"line":18,"column":45,"offset":561}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":519},"end":{"line":18,"column":45,"offset":561}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1,"offset":517},"end":{"line":18,"column":45,"offset":561}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1,"offset":388},"end":{"line":18,"column":45,"offset":561}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"因此，創建 NFT 涉及部署一個智能合約或介面，其功能包括：","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":565},"end":{"line":20,"column":31,"offset":595}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":565},"end":{"line":20,"column":31,"offset":595}}},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"start":null,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"創建一個小數位為零的鑄幣賬戶","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":3,"offset":599},"end":{"line":21,"column":17,"offset":613}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":3,"offset":599},"end":{"line":21,"column":17,"offset":613}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":597},"end":{"line":21,"column":17,"offset":613}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"將單個代幣鑄造到擁有者的錢包","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":3,"offset":617},"end":{"line":22,"column":17,"offset":631}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":3,"offset":617},"end":{"line":22,"column":17,"offset":631}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":615},"end":{"line":22,"column":17,"offset":631}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"撤銷鑄幣權限以防止未來的鑄造","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":3,"offset":635},"end":{"line":23,"column":17,"offset":649}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":3,"offset":635},"end":{"line":23,"column":17,"offset":649}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":633},"end":{"line":23,"column":17,"offset":649}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"關聯包含代幣描述信息的元數據賬戶","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":653},"end":{"line":24,"column":19,"offset":669}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":653},"end":{"line":24,"column":19,"offset":669}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1,"offset":651},"end":{"line":24,"column":19,"offset":669}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":597},"end":{"line":24,"column":19,"offset":669}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"現有的協議大大簡化了這一複雜性。Solana 的開發者通常使用由 ","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":673},"end":{"line":26,"column":34,"offset":706}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://metaplex.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Metaplex","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":35,"offset":707},"end":{"line":26,"column":43,"offset":715}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":34,"offset":706},"end":{"line":26,"column":66,"offset":738}}},{"type":"text","value":" 開發的 ","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":66,"offset":738},"end":{"line":26,"column":71,"offset":743}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mpl-token-metadata","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":71,"offset":743},"end":{"line":26,"column":91,"offset":763}}},{"type":"text","value":" 或 ","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":91,"offset":763},"end":{"line":26,"column":94,"offset":766}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mpl-core","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":94,"offset":766},"end":{"line":26,"column":104,"offset":776}}},{"type":"text","value":" 等程序，這些程序處理技術實現細節，並提供標準化的介面，用於 NFT 的創建和管理。","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":104,"offset":776},"end":{"line":26,"column":146,"offset":818}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":673},"end":{"line":26,"column":146,"offset":818}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Why Non-Fungible Tokens Matter","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":17,"offset":838},"end":{"line":28,"column":54,"offset":875}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"why-non-fungible-tokens-matter","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":55,"offset":876},"end":{"line":28,"column":90,"offset":911}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":91,"offset":912},"end":{"line":28,"column":101,"offset":922}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1,"offset":822},"end":{"line":28,"column":104,"offset":925}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NFT 是第一個能夠在無需信任的中介的情況下實現可證明的數字所有權的技術解決方案。在 NFT 出現之前，數字資產僅存在於集中式平台內，所有權可能會被隨意撤銷。","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1,"offset":929},"end":{"line":30,"column":80,"offset":1008}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1,"offset":929},"end":{"line":30,"column":80,"offset":1008}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NFTs 在協議層面上獨立運作，建立了真正的數碼財產權。","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":3,"offset":1014},"end":{"line":32,"column":31,"offset":1042}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":3,"offset":1014},"end":{"line":32,"column":31,"offset":1042}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1,"offset":1012},"end":{"line":32,"column":31,"offset":1042}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"相較於實體資產的優勢","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":5,"offset":1050},"end":{"line":34,"column":15,"offset":1060}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1,"offset":1046},"end":{"line":34,"column":15,"offset":1060}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NFTs 通過啟用可編程邏輯來改進實體資產的擁有權，這些邏輯會根據預定條件作出反應。","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1,"offset":1064},"end":{"line":36,"column":43,"offset":1106}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1,"offset":1064},"end":{"line":36,"column":43,"offset":1106}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"智能合約可以在 NFTs 在二級市場出售時，自動向創作者分發版稅。","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1,"offset":1110},"end":{"line":38,"column":34,"offset":1143}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1,"offset":1110},"end":{"line":38,"column":34,"offset":1143}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轉移限制可以防止敏感資產的未經授權移動，而基於時間的機制可以根據特定日期或條件解鎖功能或更改屬性。","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1,"offset":1147},"end":{"line":40,"column":50,"offset":1196}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1,"offset":1147},"end":{"line":40,"column":50,"offset":1196}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"某些 NFTs 甚至可以動態更新其視覺或功能屬性，響應外部數據源或用戶互動。","position":{"start":{"line":42,"column":1,"offset":1200},"end":{"line":42,"column":39,"offset":1238}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":42,"column":1,"offset":1200},"end":{"line":42,"column":39,"offset":1238}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"新的經濟模式","position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":5,"offset":1246},"end":{"line":44,"column":11,"offset":1252}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1,"offset":1242},"end":{"line":44,"column":11,"offset":1252}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NFTs 解鎖了傳統系統無法支持的經濟結構。","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1,"offset":1256},"end":{"line":46,"column":23,"offset":1278}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1,"offset":1256},"end":{"line":46,"column":23,"offset":1278}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"創作者經濟改變了藝術家產生收入的方式，通過建立永久的版稅流——每次 NFT 易手，原創創作者都會自動收到銷售價格的一部分。","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1282},"end":{"line":48,"column":62,"offset":1343}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1282},"end":{"line":48,"column":62,"offset":1343}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"這創造了遠超初始銷售的可持續收入模式。","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":1347},"end":{"line":50,"column":20,"offset":1366}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":1347},"end":{"line":50,"column":20,"offset":1366}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"社群擁有權通過集體 NFT 治理而出現，群體可以共同擁有有價值的數碼資產，並通過去中心化的投票機制決定其使用方式。","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1370},"end":{"line":52,"column":58,"offset":1427}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1370},"end":{"line":52,"column":58,"offset":1427}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"同時，數碼勞動補償為在線社群、創意合作和虛擬世界的發展提供了新的獎勵框架，這是傳統就業結構無法容納的。","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1431},"end":{"line":54,"column":52,"offset":1482}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1431},"end":{"line":54,"column":52,"offset":1482}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"可組合性與互操作性","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":5,"offset":1490},"end":{"line":56,"column":14,"offset":1499}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1486},"end":{"line":56,"column":14,"offset":1499}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NFTs 在應用程序和協議之間實現了完全的可組合性，為數碼資產的實用性創造了前所未有的靈活性。","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":1503},"end":{"line":58,"column":48,"offset":1550}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":1503},"end":{"line":58,"column":48,"offset":1550}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"單個遊戲物品 NFT 可以同時在多個具有不同機制的遊戲中運作，展示於數碼畫廊和虛擬世界中，作為 DeFi 協議中的抵押品以獲取貸款或進行收益農耕，並通過智能合約集成與其他協議互動。","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1,"offset":1554},"end":{"line":60,"column":91,"offset":1644}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1,"offset":1554},"end":{"line":60,"column":91,"offset":1644}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"這種互操作性無需原創者的許可即可運作，建立真正開放的數字經濟，資產的價值來自網絡效應和跨平台的實用性，而非平台特定的限制。","position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1,"offset":1648},"end":{"line":62,"column":62,"offset":1709}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1,"offset":1648},"end":{"line":62,"column":62,"offset":1709}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Collections","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":17,"offset":1729},"end":{"line":64,"column":35,"offset":1747}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"collections","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":36,"offset":1748},"end":{"line":64,"column":52,"offset":1764}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":53,"offset":1765},"end":{"line":64,"column":63,"offset":1775}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":1,"offset":1713},"end":{"line":64,"column":66,"offset":1778}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"一個收藏代表一組具有共同屬性、主題或來源的NFT，從而在不同資產之間創建可驗證的鏈上關係。","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1,"offset":1782},"end":{"line":66,"column":46,"offset":1827}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1,"offset":1782},"end":{"line":66,"column":46,"offset":1827}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"由於理論上任何人都可以創建NFT並虛假聲稱屬於某個知名收藏，收藏通常由一個權威機構（通常是原創者或授權實體）來驗證哪些NFT是真正屬於該收藏的。","position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1,"offset":1831},"end":{"line":68,"column":73,"offset":1903}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1,"offset":1831},"end":{"line":68,"column":73,"offset":1903}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"這個驗證過程在NFT的元數據中創建了一個不可更改的鏈上記錄，確立了無法在創建後偽造或操縱的真實收藏成員資格。","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1,"offset":1907},"end":{"line":70,"column":55,"offset":1961}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1,"offset":1907},"end":{"line":70,"column":55,"offset":1961}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"收藏在NFT生態系統中具有多個關鍵功能。它們使相關資產的高效發現和瀏覽成為可能，為創作者提供品牌身份和主題一致性，確立來源和真實性驗證，並為收藏資產持有者之間的社區治理和共享體驗創建框架。","position":{"start":{"line":72,"column":1,"offset":1965},"end":{"line":72,"column":95,"offset":2059}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":72,"column":1,"offset":1965},"end":{"line":72,"column":95,"offset":2059}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"此外，它們提供了一種非常高效的方式來邏輯地分組相關的代幣，同時保持其個體的獨特性和屬性，使同類型資產的訪問控制更加高效和低成本。","position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":1,"offset":2063},"end":{"line":74,"column":65,"offset":2127}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":1,"offset":2063},"end":{"line":74,"column":65,"offset":2127}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Metadata","position":{"start":{"line":76,"column":17,"offset":2147},"end":{"line":76,"column":32,"offset":2162}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"metadata","position":{"start":{"line":76,"column":33,"offset":2163},"end":{"line":76,"column":46,"offset":2176}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":76,"column":47,"offset":2177},"end":{"line":76,"column":57,"offset":2187}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":76,"column":1,"offset":2131},"end":{"line":76,"column":60,"offset":2190}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"元數據作為描述層，將原始的NFT代幣轉化為有意義的數字資產。","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1,"offset":2194},"end":{"line":78,"column":31,"offset":2224}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1,"offset":2194},"end":{"line":78,"column":31,"offset":2224}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"雖然區塊鏈僅存儲基本的代幣信息：所有權、供應量和基本標識符；元數據提供了豐富的上下文，使可替代和不可替代代幣在應用中具有價值和可用性。","position":{"start":{"line":80,"column":1,"offset":2228},"end":{"line":80,"column":68,"offset":2295}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":80,"column":1,"offset":2228},"end":{"line":80,"column":68,"offset":2295}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"元數據結構通常遵循既定標準，以確保錢包、市場和應用程序無論代幣由哪個程序創建，都能一致地解釋和顯示NFT信息。","position":{"start":{"line":82,"column":1,"offset":2299},"end":{"line":82,"column":56,"offset":2354}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":82,"column":1,"offset":2299},"end":{"line":82,"column":56,"offset":2354}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"該元數據包括資產的名稱和描述等基本元素，為 NFT 所代表的內容提供了人類可讀的上下文。","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":2358},"end":{"line":84,"column":45,"offset":2402}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":2358},"end":{"line":84,"column":45,"offset":2402}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"圖像欄位包含指向視覺資產的 URI，無論是數字藝術、個人頭像還是遊戲物品插圖。對於更複雜的媒體，額外的欄位可以引用動畫、3D 模型或互動內容，讓 NFT 在兼容的應用程式中栩栩如生。","position":{"start":{"line":86,"column":1,"offset":2406},"end":{"line":86,"column":92,"offset":2497}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":86,"column":1,"offset":2406},"end":{"line":86,"column":92,"offset":2497}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"自定義屬性將元數據擴展到基本描述之外，實現了更高級的分類和篩選系統。這些屬性可以表示收藏品中的稀有特徵、遊戲資產中的統計屬性，或功能性代幣中的實用參數。靈活的屬性系統允許創作者嵌入任何能提升 NFT 價值或功能的相關數據。","position":{"start":{"line":88,"column":1,"offset":2501},"end":{"line":88,"column":112,"offset":2612}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":88,"column":1,"offset":2501},"end":{"line":88,"column":112,"offset":2612}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"一些項目將元數據直接存儲在鏈上以實現最大程度的永久性（我們稱之為銘刻的過程），另一些則使用像 IPFS 或 Arweave 這樣的去中心化存儲解決方案來平衡成本與耐久性，還有一些使用集中式數據庫。主要的區別在於所選的存儲方法會直接影響 NFT 的長期可訪問性以及創作者對相關內容的持續維護責任。","position":{"start":{"line":90,"column":1,"offset":2616},"end":{"line":90,"column":148,"offset":2763}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":90,"column":1,"offset":2616},"end":{"line":90,"column":148,"offset":2763}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":90,"column":148,"offset":2763}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Solana 上的 NFT\r\n\r\n![Solana 上的 NFT](/graphics/course-banners/nfts-on-solana.png)\r\n\r\n非同質化代幣（NFT）是具有特定特徵的數字代幣，這些特徵使其與像加密貨幣這樣的同質化代幣有所不同。\r\n\r\n與每個單位都相同且可互換的同質化代幣不同，NFT 代表獨特的、不可分割的數字資產，無法被複製或細分。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"NFTs Properties\" id=\"nft-properties\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n要使代幣符合真正 NFT 的資格，它必須具備以下基本特性：\r\n- 不可分割性：不包含小數位，確保您無法擁有 0.1 個 NFT 這樣的分數\r\n- 獨特性：供應量恰好為 1，保證僅存在一個實例\r\n- 固定供應量：不存在鑄造權限，防止創建額外的代幣\r\n- 可分組性：可以組織成集合，將相似的代幣分組，同時保持個體的獨特性\r\n- 豐富的元數據：包括可讀數據，例如名稱、描述、圖片和其他屬性，用於在瀏覽器和錢包中顯示\r\n\r\n因此，創建 NFT 涉及部署一個智能合約或介面，其功能包括：\r\n- 創建一個小數位為零的鑄幣賬戶\r\n- 將單個代幣鑄造到擁有者的錢包\r\n- 撤銷鑄幣權限以防止未來的鑄造\r\n- 關聯包含代幣描述信息的元數據賬戶\r\n\r\n現有的協議大大簡化了這一複雜性。Solana 的開發者通常使用由 [Metaplex](https://metaplex.com) 開發的 `mpl-token-metadata` 或 `mpl-core` 等程序，這些程序處理技術實現細節，並提供標準化的介面，用於 NFT 的創建和管理。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Why Non-Fungible Tokens Matter\" id=\"why-non-fungible-tokens-matter\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nNFT 是第一個能夠在無需信任的中介的情況下實現可證明的數字所有權的技術解決方案。在 NFT 出現之前，數字資產僅存在於集中式平台內，所有權可能會被隨意撤銷。\r\n\r\n> NFTs 在協議層面上獨立運作，建立了真正的數碼財產權。\r\n\r\n### 相較於實體資產的優勢\r\n\r\nNFTs 通過啟用可編程邏輯來改進實體資產的擁有權，這些邏輯會根據預定條件作出反應。\r\n\r\n智能合約可以在 NFTs 在二級市場出售時，自動向創作者分發版稅。\r\n\r\n轉移限制可以防止敏感資產的未經授權移動，而基於時間的機制可以根據特定日期或條件解鎖功能或更改屬性。\r\n\r\n某些 NFTs 甚至可以動態更新其視覺或功能屬性，響應外部數據源或用戶互動。\r\n\r\n### 新的經濟模式\r\n\r\nNFTs 解鎖了傳統系統無法支持的經濟結構。\r\n\r\n創作者經濟改變了藝術家產生收入的方式，通過建立永久的版稅流——每次 NFT 易手，原創創作者都會自動收到銷售價格的一部分。\r\n\r\n這創造了遠超初始銷售的可持續收入模式。\r\n\r\n社群擁有權通過集體 NFT 治理而出現，群體可以共同擁有有價值的數碼資產，並通過去中心化的投票機制決定其使用方式。\r\n\r\n同時，數碼勞動補償為在線社群、創意合作和虛擬世界的發展提供了新的獎勵框架，這是傳統就業結構無法容納的。\r\n\r\n### 可組合性與互操作性\r\n\r\nNFTs 在應用程序和協議之間實現了完全的可組合性，為數碼資產的實用性創造了前所未有的靈活性。\r\n\r\n單個遊戲物品 NFT 可以同時在多個具有不同機制的遊戲中運作，展示於數碼畫廊和虛擬世界中，作為 DeFi 協議中的抵押品以獲取貸款或進行收益農耕，並通過智能合約集成與其他協議互動。\r\n\r\n這種互操作性無需原創者的許可即可運作，建立真正開放的數字經濟，資產的價值來自網絡效應和跨平台的實用性，而非平台特定的限制。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Collections\" id=\"collections\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n一個收藏代表一組具有共同屬性、主題或來源的NFT，從而在不同資產之間創建可驗證的鏈上關係。\r\n\r\n由於理論上任何人都可以創建NFT並虛假聲稱屬於某個知名收藏，收藏通常由一個權威機構（通常是原創者或授權實體）來驗證哪些NFT是真正屬於該收藏的。\r\n\r\n這個驗證過程在NFT的元數據中創建了一個不可更改的鏈上記錄，確立了無法在創建後偽造或操縱的真實收藏成員資格。\r\n\r\n收藏在NFT生態系統中具有多個關鍵功能。它們使相關資產的高效發現和瀏覽成為可能，為創作者提供品牌身份和主題一致性，確立來源和真實性驗證，並為收藏資產持有者之間的社區治理和共享體驗創建框架。\r\n\r\n此外，它們提供了一種非常高效的方式來邏輯地分組相關的代幣，同時保持其個體的獨特性和屬性，使同類型資產的訪問控制更加高效和低成本。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Metadata\" id=\"metadata\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n元數據作為描述層，將原始的NFT代幣轉化為有意義的數字資產。\r\n\r\n雖然區塊鏈僅存儲基本的代幣信息：所有權、供應量和基本標識符；元數據提供了豐富的上下文，使可替代和不可替代代幣在應用中具有價值和可用性。\r\n\r\n元數據結構通常遵循既定標準，以確保錢包、市場和應用程序無論代幣由哪個程序創建，都能一致地解釋和顯示NFT信息。\r\n\r\n該元數據包括資產的名稱和描述等基本元素，為 NFT 所代表的內容提供了人類可讀的上下文。\r\n\r\n圖像欄位包含指向視覺資產的 URI，無論是數字藝術、個人頭像還是遊戲物品插圖。對於更複雜的媒體，額外的欄位可以引用動畫、3D 模型或互動內容，讓 NFT 在兼容的應用程式中栩栩如生。\r\n\r\n自定義屬性將元數據擴展到基本描述之外，實現了更高級的分類和篩選系統。這些屬性可以表示收藏品中的稀有特徵、遊戲資產中的統計屬性，或功能性代幣中的實用參數。靈活的屬性系統允許創作者嵌入任何能提升 NFT 價值或功能的相關數據。\r\n\r\n一些項目將元數據直接存儲在鏈上以實現最大程度的永久性（我們稱之為銘刻的過程），另一些則使用像 IPFS 或 Arweave 這樣的去中心化存儲解決方案來平衡成本與耐久性，還有一些使用集中式數據庫。主要的區別在於所選的存儲方法會直接影響 NFT 的長期可訪問性以及創作者對相關內容的持續維護責任。","highlightedCode":{}}